OL,3,GNEWSACritical incident stood down at
OL,4,Ahospital trust
OL,5,
OL,6,FA critical incident declared at an NHS
OL,7,Fhospital trust in Derby has been stood
OL,8,Fdown.
OL,10,FUniversity Hospitals of Derby and
OL,11,FBurton (UHDB) NHS Foundation Trust
OL,12,Fannounced the critical incident on
OL,13,FTuesday after seasonal respiratory
OL,14,Fillness, including flu and Covid-19,
OL,15,Fadded to pressures on its services.
OL,17,FUHDB, which runs Royal Derby Hospital
OL,18,Fand Queen's Hospital Burton, said on
OL,19,FThursday it had "improved significantly
OL,20,Fwith faster ambulance handovers,
OL,21,Fdischarge and overall patient flow".
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
