OL,3,GNEWSACritical incident stood down at
OL,4,Ahospital trust
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trust said its position would
OL,7,F"continue to be monitored" and was
OL,8,Furging people to only come to hospital
OL,9,Fduring an emergency.
